window.products.push({"id":549015,"name":"2 Tier Lazy Susan - 2 Pack Stainless Steel 360 Degree Turntable – Rotating Tabletop Stand for Your Dining Table, Kitchen Counters and Cabinets – Spice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+9ix1jmNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pack of 2 -- ORGANIZE YOUR KITCHEN IN STYLE: Dimensions: 10\" diameter -- Keep all the jars with the spices and condiments, other small containers, and the table napkins organized with the 1tier Lazy Susan. The rotating turntable will allow you to save space and keep your seasonings within easy reach. You can place the 1-tier turntable in your kitchen counter or cabinet and even on your dining table, so that everyone can reach for the salt, pepper or napkins by themselves. A BEAUTIFUL SERVING 2 TIER TRAY: Apart from using the 2 tier Lazy Susan as a spice rack organizer, you can also use it as a grand serving tray to serve your meal during family dinners. The 360° swiveling tabletop stand will also offer you a true British tea drinking experience, since you can serve finger food, scones and other afternoon tea snacks on it while you’re enjoying your tea or coffee with your friends. The options are endless! STURDY ROTATING CONSTRUCTION: No matter how many jars and other items you put on the 2 tier of the rotating Lazy Susan, they will never fall and create a mess. The two levels of the Lovotex swiveling table stand have raised rims which will prevent any item from sliding off. Thanks to the smart and safe design, and the sturdy construction, this is the safest and strongest two tier turntable on the market! Try it out and see for yourself! STAINLESS STEEL WILL NEVER FAIL YOU: Made with heavy duty stainless steel, this 2 tier Lazy Susan does not only look sleek and elegant, but it is also extremely durable. The corrosion resistant stainless steel trays can be hand washed and thanks to their brushed finished, your fingerprints will not leave marks. Get the metal 1-tier turntable now and, trust us, you will never have to replace it with a new one – that’s a promise. ASSEMBLE IT FAST AND EFFORTLESSLY: The Lovotex 360-degree turntable does not arrive to you preassembled. But don’t worry, because the assembly of the two stainless steel trays is going to be fast, easy and effortless. All of the pieces that you need for the setup are included in the package. All you have to do is take them out and follow the instructions. Soon the two-tiered turntable organizer will be sturdy and ready to be used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+9ix1jmNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lovotex","source_asin":"B07F1FJNKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F1FJNKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F1FJNKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
