window.products.push({"id":549031,"name":"GoJars Hexagon Glass Jars 1.5oz Premium Food-grade. Mini Jars With Lids For Gifts, Wedding Favors, Honey, Jams And More. (24, 1.5oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817RHcfUbZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elegant Glass Jars: They're stylish, practical & versatile for any event, occassion, or DIY activity you want to try. These hexagon glass jars are suitable as honey jars, canning jars & even containers for homemade body scrubs, body butters & more! GoJars small jars that stack easily with all other sizes too for a clean pantry & kitchen. Reliable & Functional: Our 1.5 oz glass jars with lids are easy to clean, seal well (when tightened form an air-tight seal), & can be boiled for making homemade goodies. The lids are made of metal, while the glass jar body is microwave, fridge & dishwasher safe. Crystal Clear Glass: We use a thick & durable glass for all of our mini jars, ensuring your home's safety, they're all food safe & BPA Free. They make perfect little party favors as honey jars for weddings, or treats for a winnie the pooh baby shower. You can even decorate the outside since the smooth flat glass offers an easy way to personalize the jars. Crafted for your Home: enjoy mixing & matching our jars to create amazing sets of spice jars, sugar scrub tubs, lotions or essential oil diffusers. From 1.5oz glass jars to 6oz glass jars, our selection of mini jars can complement any kitchen or party for a cozier feel. Pair ceramic mugs with our honey jars in bulk for an awesome tea & honey jar party favor. Go Jars Go! Beyond food & self care kits, you can also make mini herb gardens with our medium sized glass jars, or hanging succulent pots (don't forget to make a drainage hole). There's lots to do, in case you have further feedback, we'd love to hear what you've done with the jars! Sincerely, the GoJars team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817RHcfUbZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoJars","source_asin":"B01J91OV46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J91OV46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J91OV46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":549032,"name":"Vandor 99561 Star Wars Darth Vader 18 oz Oval Ceramic Mug, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b3Hu8oVZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Star Wars was destined to change the face of cinema forever. It was an instant classic and an unparalleled box office success. The epic space fantasy introduced the mystical Force into cultural vocabulary, as well as iconic characters such as Darth Vader, Luke Skywalker, Princess Leia, Han Solo, Obi-Wan Kenobi and Yoda. Star Wars products include merchandise, gifts and memorabilia featuring timeless images on mugs, lunch boxes, clocks, glasses and more. This Star Wars Darth Vader 18-ounce oval ceramic mug is custom sculpted and beautifully crafted to make it one of a kind. It features photo quality Darth Vader images on both sides and is microwave and dishwasher safe. It is a perfect holiday gift for any Star Wars fan, young or old. Making retro cool since 1957, legends live on at Vandor - suppliers of hip and functional products for fans of all ages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b3Hu8oVZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STAR WARS","source_asin":"B00FC7JIAO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FC7JIAO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FC7JIAO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
