window.products.push({"id":549055,"name":"Delta Children Gavin Recliner Glider Swivel Chair Featuring LiveSmart Fabric by Culp - Stain-Resistant, Repels Moisture, Kid & Pet-Friendly Fabric, Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NDsVAJGNL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ideal for story time or late night feedings, the Delta Children Gavin Nursery Glider Swivel Recliner featuring LiveSmart Fabric by Culp will become the ultimate hangout spot for you and your baby. The chair features plenty of ways to unwind, it has a 360-degree swivel, gliding motion, and an easy-to-reach reclining mechanism that offers two recline positions. You can keep the seat upright and just prop up your legs or fully recline for maximum relaxation. Upholstered in the most durable fabric on the market, this recliner features LiveSmart technology, which allows spills to bead up, sitting on top of the fabric until you gently blot them away. The fabric does more than prevent stains and repel moisture--it resists everyday messes to keep the chair looking as beautiful as the day you bought it. And that's not all, this versatile recliner works well in the nursery or any other living space in your home. Its sophisticated design with buttonless tufting and streamlined silhouette makes it a timeless choice. The Delta Children Gavin Nursery Glider Swivel Recliner featuring LiveSmart Fabric by Culp is available in a number of versatile neutrals that work well with everything. Delta Children was founded around the idea of making safe, high-quality children's furniture affordable for all families. They know there's nothing more important than safety when it comes to your child's space. That's why all Delta Children products are built with long-lasting materials to ensure they stand up to years of jumping and playing. Plus, they are rigorously tested to meet or exceed all industry safety standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NDsVAJGNL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delta Children","source_asin":"B079QGZLF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079QGZLF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079QGZLF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
