window.products.push({"id":549183,"name":"Ronco Pizza & More, Pizza Oven with Warming Tray, Countertop Open-Air Convection Oven, Cooks 40% Faster, Party Convection Oven, Automatic Shut-Off Tim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6134uSCiNjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get ready to party with the Ronco Pizza & More countertop convection oven. Not only does the Pizza & More cook homemade and frozen pizza to perfection, it’s also perfect for all your favorite finger foods and appetizers.  Thanks to dual heating elements and the open-air, rotating pan you can prepare your food 40% faster than your traditional oven. Plus, the included warming tray is perfect for serving while waiting on the next batch to finish. And, you never have to worry about overcooking or overheating; this pizza oven features an automatic 30-minute shut off timer.  Make your favorite homemade pizza, frozen appetizers and other fun finger foods quickly and easily with the Ronco Pizza & More. You’ll love how easy it is!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6134uSCiNjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ronco","source_asin":"B089MZ2JRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089MZ2JRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089MZ2JRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":549184,"name":"Home Dynamix Area Rug, 7 ft 10 in x 10 ft 2 in, Gray/Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1tDZ8cpi4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform any living space into an inviting, modern oasis with the unique New Weave area rug collection by Home Dynamix. The New Weave collection offers various geometric inspired designs. With a beautiful kaleidoscope of color featuring ivory, charcoal, coral and blue, these graphic area rugs are sure to impress your guests as they are welcomed into your home. Bold geometric patterns create an artistic environment to inspire you daily. Creating the illusion of movement and three-dimensional patterns, the New Weave area rug is designed with triangular and diamond-like patterns that will captivate the eye and excite your senses. In addition to their psychedelic, 70s-inspired flair, these area rugs will offer instant comfort to your home. With ultra-soft and cozy polypropylene fibers, youll appreciate luxurious softness underfoot as you walk about or while you cozy up to watch TV or read a book. Add rugs to your living room, bedroom, family room or home office for a style thats all your own. Mix in contemporary, mid-century modern furniture pieces into each room to highlight your New Weave rug and completely update your home décor. Each design within this beautiful collection offers a room statement piece and visual flair with color and style. Stunning and functional, these area rugs are made to last and endure high traffic areas, owing to their high-quality construction and strong polypropylene fibers. Layer your New Weave area rug by Home Dynamix on top of existing carpeting to define areas or create visual interest or adorn hardwood or tile flooring for long-lasting protection. Although the natural jute backing on this luxury rug is gentle on most floors, it is recommended that you use a non-skid padding underneath to protect floors and minimize any slipping of the rug as you walk. Our Home Dynamix Ultra Stop Non-Skid Cushioned Rug Pad is sold separately on Amazon. Find the page by searching for style # B0011VS6W6 and pick the size that works best for your rug purchase. Preservation of these beautiful rugs is simple as they are naturally stain and fade resistant; spot clean as needed and vacuum regularly to refresh the yarns. Rugs power loomed in Turkey. New Weave 7'10\" x 10'2\" 168-483","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1tDZ8cpi4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Dynamix","source_asin":"B08S5BB5BQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S5BB5BQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S5BB5BQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
