window.products.push({"id":549211,"name":"The Fine Life Ideal Salt and Pepper Mill Set Spice Grinders - Short Pair w/matching Stand Bonus FREE ebook: Cooking w/Seasonings - Adjustable Manual C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oqzwDFv+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cook With Fresh Spices, Always - No more stale spices! The stainless steel air tight lid keeps your seasonings fresh so each time you use your grinder you get truly fresh ground flavor and scents whether you are using himalayan salt, pepper, cardamon, allspice, dried seed or other spices.*Salt, pepper and spices are not included with your purchase. 3 Elegant and Quality Models - Whether you purchase our Tall Grinder Pair, the Short Pair in their Matching Stand, or the 2in1 Tube style, these grinders look great on your counter or table top. They fit comfortably in your hands and work with the coarsest salt, peppers, dry spice and more with confidence. Convenience and Performance - Carry this pair between your kitchen and dining room or patio. Unlike other dry spice grinder sets, this salt and pepper mill model has a recessed grinding mechanism, ensuring your spices end up only on your food -- not all over your counter or table. The non-corrosive ceramic mechanism does not absorb flavors. The plastic knob at the center of each mill allows you to easily adjust from fine powder to coarse ground Simple to Use and Easy to Refill - The perfect kitchen gadget for Chefs, Bakers and BBQ warriors, holding plenty of spices, this model is the perfect size to hold your fresh spices without constant refilling. The clear body lets you know when it time. The stainless steel section easily unscrews to provide a wide opening - filling without creating a mess Effortless Guarantee - If you're not completely satisfied, we'll give you a 100% refund within 90 days of purchase--No questions asked. We have the outstanding customer service rating on Amazon, and YOU, the customer, are our top priority. Add a set to your shopping cart today for yourself and for gifts - a risk-free culinary experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oqzwDFv+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Fine Life","source_asin":"B01HN72YA6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HN72YA6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HN72YA6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":549212,"name":"Turkey Roasting Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MGU6HGOfL._AC_.jpg","description":"Make sure this years Thanksgiving turkey comes out absolutely perfect using this turkey roasting kit. This set includes an armored meat thermometer, a no-sew turkey lacer, a turkey lifter (also ideal for roasts), and a turkey stuffer bag, as well as in depth directions on how to use them all. In addition, this kit also includes a roasting time and temperature chart and a Hueck's famous poultry dressing recipe. Tremendous value for a low cost!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MGU6HGOfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heuck","source_asin":"B00172X6CO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00172X6CO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00172X6CO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":549213,"name":"Bubble Waffle Maker- Electric Nonstick Hong Kong Egg Waffler Iron Griddle w Ready Indicator Light- Ready in under 5 Mins- Recipe Guide Included Make H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VU8HvebML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CucinaPro Bubble Waffler: Enjoy a tasty treat that's been transported all the way from the sidewalk vendors of Hong Kong with this Cucina Pro Bubble Waffler. This unique waffle maker creates a large hexagon shaped waffle which has a unique bubbled texture. These delicious waffles, sometimes called egg waffles or eggettes have crispy golden outsides and light, tender interiors. An eggette is a kind of spherical pancake or ball waffle popular in Hong Kong and Macao. The food item is also referred to as an egg puff, egg waffle, bubble waffle or by its Cantonese name, gai daan and is made from eggs, sugar, flour, and light evaporated milk. They are best served hot, and often eaten plain. They can also be served with fruit and flavors such as strawberry, coconut or chocolate.They are sometimes referred to as \"Hong Kong cakes\" in Chinatowns across America, especially in New York. Eggettes are one of the most popular Hong Kong \"street snacks\" and they have been a favoured street snack in HK since their emergence in 1950s and were made with coal fire heating, sold from street kiosks in Hong Kong in the early days. They are made from a sweet batter that is cooked on a hot griddle, a special frying pan with small round \"wells\" (resembling a Æbleskiver but with smaller and more of the round \"wells\") and with them set on hot coals in the fire or more commonly, on an electrical heat generator. The egg batter is poured over the special frying pan and heated; the small ovals of eggettes are thus formed. In addition to the conventional \"egg taste\", they are also available in a variety of flavours such as chocolate, green-tea and ginger, etc. Most pancakes are quick breads, although some are also made using a yeast-raised or fermented batter. Eggettes can be eaten at different times of the day depending on local tradition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VU8HvebML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CucinaPro","source_asin":"B00CO9BGYE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CO9BGYE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CO9BGYE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
