window.products.push({"id":549277,"name":"Marvel Visons: Wolverine Signed by Alex Ross Framed Fine Art Canvas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V94DrpqgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Choice Global Fine Art & Choice Collectibles Present Marvel Fine Art: Visions Wolverine Comic-book-illustrator-turned-fine-artist Alex Ross continues his Visions series with this new release of Wolverine. The third of these dramatic Portraits, Visions: Wolverine is a great companion to its counterparts in the series. The legendary comic book illustrator's artistic magnificence is readily apparent in Visions: Wolverine. From the sheen of Wolverine's razor-sharp claws glinting in the light to the detail in his face, arm hair, and musculature, this powerful piece makes the perfect addition of strength to any room in desperate need of a gritty superhero to toughen it up! Alex Ross is one of the leading illustrators in comic art today and the most prolific in his generation. Dubbed \"the Norman Rockwell of comics,\" his realistic, human depictions of classic comic book characters for Marvel and DC Comics have cemented his position in the pantheon of comic book and contemporary pop culture art. Ross has won countless awards and had his art displayed in fine art galleries around the world alongside fellow fine art greats. Through his incredible mastery of action, background, details, and his fantastic representations of humanity, Alex Ross has positively changed how comic books are drawn for good. \"Alex Ross has administered a super powered transfusion to the medium. photo-realistic artwork. One would swear these mythical pop culture heroes really do walk our streets and soar in our skies\" -Chicago Tribune Choice Collectibles is the industry leader in animation, superhero, and pop culture art. As licensed publishers of Marvel Fine Art, we have risen to top of the pop culture art world by providing the finest DC, Marvel, Disney, Warner Brothers, Hanna Barbera and Peanuts animation cells and art. With over 20 years in the pop and vintage art business, our longstanding commitment to creating and distributing the most visually stunning, limited-edition art is simply unmatched.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81V94DrpqgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marvel","source_asin":"B00O9O1CC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O9O1CC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O9O1CC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
