window.products.push({"id":549372,"name":"mDesign Modern Metal Household Expandable and Adjustable Rod - Expands from 19.5\" to 30\" Wide, Easy to Install, for Bedroom, Closet, Mudroom, Entryway","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31D+eZrRXHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ADJUSTABLE STORAGE: Rod provides strong, reliable storage inside a closet anywhere around the home; Use it in any closet space in the laundry room, bedroom, office, mudroom, children's bedroom, guest room, basement or anywhere you need to add more storage options for hanging up clothing, coats, robes, outerwear and more; Set of 2 EASY INSTALLATION: Rod easily installs onto solid wall surfaces with the included hardware; Expand to create a customized fit your storage area; Follow the easy to read instructions included with the item to ensure a strong, secure hold FUNCTIONAL & VERSATILE: The rod provides instant storage inside a closet space to create hanging options for coats, robes, suits, out-of-season clothing and more; Strong and secure, this rod can also support curtains; This rod is also great for hanging window coverings and drapery in narrower window openings in living rooms, family rooms, home office, bedrooms, kitchens and more QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Made of strong steel with a durable rust-resistant finish; Easy Care - Wipe clean with damp cloth THOUGHTFULLY SIZED:Each Measures 1\" x 17.5\" x 2\"; Expands from 19.5\" to 30\" wide","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31D+eZrRXHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mDesign","source_asin":"B07SKC8L1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SKC8L1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SKC8L1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":549373,"name":"Prochaska Gallery Hand Blown Glass Unicorn Rearing Crystal Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":192.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hG90tz9yL._AC_SL1467_.jpg","description":"Hand blown glass unicorn rearing proudly is a stunning work of art worthy of the finest crystal collections. Kevin Prochaska, Disneyland glass blower for 10 years is the artist. Throughout the many years I spent at Disneyland, no other figurine was requested as frequently as the unicorn. Having the good fortune to be able to create this magical creature for thousands of guests and many celebrities is one of my fondest memories. The unusual details of the mane, tail and fetlocks are all created by hundreds of air bubbles that I purposely fold into the molten glass and then stretch into the hair like form. Figurine measures approximately 8 inches tall, 7 inches in length and I make it entirely by hand of borosilicate crystal. I have personally signed the sculpture and I pack it very well so that it arrives safely at its new home. Serious collectors will especially appreciate the design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hG90tz9yL._AC_SL1467_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prochaska Gallery","source_asin":"B00613DD8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00613DD8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00613DD8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
