window.products.push({"id":549416,"name":"iDesign Basket, Large, Copper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CS9iRaw+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed with style and function in mind, the iDesign Classico Large Wire Basket creates instant organization in any room around the home. This versatile basket can be used in the kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, closet, office, or wherever you need additional storage. The larger size makes it great for storing pantry items, bath and shower necessities, clothing and shoes, cleaning supplies, and more. The open top and wire design ensure contents are always visible and accessible, while the built-in handles allow for portability and quick reorganization. The durable steel construction with vibrant copper finish matches a variety of decor styles and stands up to every day use. Measuring 14.75\" x 11.75\" x 8.5\", this basket is an ideal storage solution for compact spaces. With iDesign by InterDesign, you can #LiveSimply every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CS9iRaw+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iDesign","source_asin":"B0B8J8XRLG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8J8XRLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8J8XRLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
