window.products.push({"id":549477,"name":"Owl Engraved Wood Coaster - Set of 4 - Perfect Gift for Wedding, Engagement, Anniversary, or Christmas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vM6JpN2kL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set of laser engraved wood coasters is the perfect way to show off your love of this wonderful bird! A great gift for new homeowners, anniversaries, birthdays, or Christmas. Each wood coaster features an owl illustration laser engraved on the top. The engraved wood coasters are 3.5”- 4” in diameter and 3/8” thick. The wood slice coasters compliment any living space quite well, regardless of style. The unfinished surface of the wood slices makes the perfect coaster, keeping furniture safe from moisture and heat given off by mugs or glasses. The burnt wood surface is laser engraved, giving each coaster's light face a visually pleasing contrast.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vM6JpN2kL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09Q1M6FGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q1M6FGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q1M6FGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
