window.products.push({"id":549481,"name":"Sphinx sculpture ancient Greek bronze reproduction statue on marble","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sOS45VJIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"A sphinx is a mythical creature with, as a minimum, the body of a lion and a human head. In Greek tradition, it has the haunches of a lion, sometimes with the wings of a great bird, and the face of a human. It is mythicised as treacherous and merciless. Those who cannot answer its riddle suffer a fate typical in such mythological stories, as they are killed and eaten by this ravenous monster. Bronze high quality reproduction. (34522/ ) Details: Condition: New, reproduction made in Greece. Approximately Height: 10cm - 3.9 inches Width: 14cm - 5.5 inches Weight: 0.8kg Material: Bronze","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sOS45VJIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Talos Artifacts","source_asin":"B06XFZR92X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XFZR92X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XFZR92X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
