window.products.push({"id":549521,"name":"CHUFFED Linen Queen Bed Sheet Set, 100% Stonewashed French Linen, Hypoallergenic, Breathable, Farmhouse Bed Sheet Set 4 PCS - 1 Flat Sheet, 1 Deep Poc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":105.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ziUunCvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LINEN SHEET SET: The CHUFFED linen sheet set is made from 100% French premium linen (170GSM). Flax fiber has the characteristics of strong tensile strength, softness, weak conductivity, etc., and is durable. Flax stimulates blood circulation in the skin, promotes relaxation, and helps the body fall into deep sleep faster and longer. Tip: When taking pictures, there may be slight color shifts due to different monitor settings or lighting conditions. SUITABLE FOR ALL SEASONS: Linen has good breathability and moisture absorption, which can quickly relieve overheated skin temperature and restore human comfort. And when the body's temperature is too low, linen sheets can also achieve a good warming effect, warming in winter and cool in summer. Linen is a hypoallergenic material, so you don't have to worry about an allergic reaction if you touch linen fabrics. QUEEN SIZE BED SHEET SET: 1 x Flat Sheet: 90″ x 102″, 1 x Fitted Sheet: 60″ x 80″ x 16″, 2 x Pillowcases: 20″ x 30″. Fitted sheet can accommodate mattresses up to 16″ high, excluding comforters and pillows. WASHING INSTRUCTIONS: We recommend washing pure linen sheet set at water temperatures of down to 30 °C. Do not use cleaning agents containing chlorine. Wash with similar colors. Lay flat or hang to dry naturally in a shady setting. Machine washable, remember to select gentle mode when washing and drying in the washing machine. AFTER-SALE SERVICE: If you have any questions or problems about our product, please click “Sold By” to enter the store home page, click “Ask a Question” button to contact us. CHUFFED offers you 24-hour email contact and 30-day return/exchange service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ziUunCvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHUFFED","source_asin":"B0C23TBXQ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C23TBXQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C23TBXQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":549522,"name":"Ancient Cookware, Mexican Rustic White Clay Plate, 9.5 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gjY-rN36L._AC_.jpg","description":"Our hand-made, 9 inch Mexican Rustic Clay Plate, is an excellent way of adding a rustic touch to an elegant table. It is made of extra think clay which makes it very durable. These plates veer away from tradition and achieve a beautiful modern and sleek look using design and solid colors. These plates make attractive table setting for any occasion, and match beautifully with Mexican Hand Blow glassware. Traditionally Mexican Pottery have been notorious for being produced with leaded glazes, however these plates are certified 100% Lead Free and completely safe for food use. They are dishwasher safe, and can be placed in ovens, both conventional and microwave. Care and use Clay pieces are very tough and durable and can be stacked one on top of each other. Of course they will break if dropped, impacted heavily, or because of extreme temperatures, but otherwise, they last a long and stay looking great. As such the plates must not be submitted to drastic changes in temperature, and care should be taken when handling the plates. The plates are dishwasher safe, making their care very easy, however, it is better to hand wash the plates using mild soap. Never use metal or abrasive cleaners so as to not mar the surface. If there is stuck on food, fill the plates with warm soapy water, allowing them to soak briefly then scrubbing lightly with a sponge or soft cloth. APPEARANCE Our plates are handmade and the ones with designs, hand painted. As with most products which are handmade by artisans around the world, the pieces are all individual and may vary in appearance or may have slight imperfections in the form or finish of the materials. These imperfection do not compromise the aesthetics or functionality of the pieces and are considered normal and to be expected.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gjY-rN36L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ancient Cookware","source_asin":"B01KAYL9VE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KAYL9VE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KAYL9VE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
