window.products.push({"id":549608,"name":"U-Taste 600ºF High Heat-Resistant Silicone Spatula Set and 7/9/12 inches Cooking Tong Set (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E5AJER+FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Heat Resistant Silicone Spatulas Perfect For Mixing, Scooping, Scraping Jar Spatula Because of its thin shape, it can get into the tiniest of space, like those tomato sauce jars where spoons can't fit. And the long length means it reaches right to the bottom of tall peanut butter jars.The hard side can scrape out every last drop of smoothie. Spoon Spatula The silicone spoon spatula is perfect for various cooking or baking tasks, including scooping portions, mixing ingredients with oil, scraping baked on food, stirring food in a pan, breaking up dense ingredients (minced meat), serving food from the pan into bowls and pretty much anything and everything you can think of. Mini Spatula This kitchen utensils comes with a flexible flat \"blade\" which is much more effective than a spoon when it comes to transferring the batter into a baking pan. A must have while you are baking! It is perfect for tiny jobs and tiny hands. Large Spatula This type of large silicone spatula is great for certain types of mixing, including gently folding ingredients into batter. It is also great for smoothing batter in a cake pan before baking to ensure an even distribution. Its has flat blade which can scrape the flesh from the juicer. Because of its non-stick characteristics, it is easy to clean even with batter on it. Multifunctional Tongs for Different Kitchen Scenes Great for Baked Food It's very easy to grip bread and turn potatoes in the oven and pull it out without burning yourself or dropping the bread. Stir Food While Cooking Use it as a cooking utensil to stir noodle dishes. Also very helpful for serving various pasta, cold vegetable and salad dishes. Work Well on the Grill Perfect for heavy pieces of poultry and beef. Use them to flip chicken on the stove. You can also use the fire tong on your grill for sausages and steaks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E5AJER+FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U-Taste","source_asin":"B08DP5L2PM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DP5L2PM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DP5L2PM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
