window.products.push({"id":549675,"name":"Wellwerks Cereal Storage Containers Set, 4-compartment Partitions Design Airtight Food Storage Containers, Pantry & Kitchen Organization, 4 Pcs Dispen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qfx9HSQdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Keep the Fantastic Tasty ] : Our Wellwerks airtight & watertight food storage containers have 4-sided locking lids with silicone seal, which can ensure no air or water enters in, keeping your cereal super fresh and dry. Imagine waking up every morning and enjoying the fantastic taste and crispness of the food. [ Removeable Partitions] : These airtight cereal containers have 3 removeable partitions, You can combine any type of storage space you need. The 4-compartment design make every single cereal container being more flexible and versatile. [ Ergonomic & Space Saving Design] : These 4 transformable cereal containers have been especially designed to save space and could easily fit into your kitchen,pantry, food storage room, etc. The notches on the 4 sides have a ergonomic design, and the cereal holders can easily fit into your refrigerator, freezer or cupboards which enables you to get the kitchen organized and frees up space in the pantry. [ Versatile Cereal Containers] : These durable cereal containers are made of premium plastic material and silicone,which can largely ensure food safety. Additionaly it also has a wide range of uses. The food-safe containers are not only ideal for storing cereal but also perfect for storing flour, sugar, rice, grains, pasta, coffee and even pet food. [ Convenient & Easy to Use] : The multi-fuction airtight containers with 4-compartment partitions are easy to open and use. The notches on the side make it very easy to pick up and pour out food. Each compartment is equipped with an individual opening lid, which is very convenient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qfx9HSQdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wellwerks","source_asin":"B092Z9Z15W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092Z9Z15W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092Z9Z15W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":549676,"name":"DEAYOU Potpourri Bag Gift Box, 8.8 Oz Mixed Dried Flower Bowl and Vase Filler, Home Fragrance Perfume Sachet, Spring Fall Potpourris, Thyme Scented Ai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ctUNxWzpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Healthy Home Decor: DEAYOU potpourri bag gift box has the effect of incense and refreshing environment. It is the gorgeous indoor decor that will diffuse a delightful fragrance and make your mood more pleasant. Ideal for everyday use, aromatherapy, spa, reiki, meditation, bathroom setting and more Safe Material and Unique Scent: Our fall spring potpourris is made of high-quality natural dried piny flowers herbs and dried fruits, fresh fragrance and not over-powering aroma, well scented and pet-friendly. The potpourri box measures approx. 7.3\" length x 2.4\" width x 5.7\" height with the weight of 8.8 ounces, which can easily fill any normal sized vases and bowls Wide Applications: This potpourri dried flowers bag can match well with various decorative containers, add a touch of good odor and elegant color to your house, living room, bedroom, entry way, porch, bathroom, wardrobe, fireplace, office, cafe, school and any place you want. It is also the decent table centerpiece Perfect Gift Ideas: Our creative thyme scented potpourri with clear package box is a chic ready gift for wedding, event, holiday, festival, party, visiting and housewarming. Also the delicate present for your families, friends, colleagues, boyfriends and girlfriends on Mother's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas and birthday Easy to Use: Just open the box directly or pour the material into potpourri holders and tray, vases, sachets or other containers, the scent dried flower and fruit will give off a nice smell. You can also arrange them in group with your scented candles, or use them as diffuser of your essential oil","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ctUNxWzpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEAYOU","source_asin":"B0983PSFVD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0983PSFVD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0983PSFVD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":549677,"name":"ELNIDO QUEEN All Season Down Alternative Comforter - Black 350 GSM Comforter - Duvet Insert with Corner Tabs, Quilted Bedding Comforter - Stand-Alone ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814M1ULvmAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Soft & Plush Microfiber Fill】Our comforter of soft 100% brushed Microfiber is breathable, cozy, and filled with 350 gsm.The microfiber fabric cover is noiseless and friendly to those sneezing. Medium warmth for year round. This comforter is fluffy and lightweight, not too heavy to pressure you. 【Box Stitching & Corner Tabs】The elegant design keeps the fill in place and prevents the fill from shifting, thus ensuring comfortable sleep. The four durable corner tabs are convenient for keeping in peace inside duvet cover. It can be used as a duvet insert or as a stand-alone comforter. 【Great Gift Chocie】Simple but elegant design, fits various type of decoration, adding more beauty and coziness to your bedroom. As a great gift for your family or friends on special occasions, birthday, new year, holiday. It will definitely guarantee you a restful, tranquil and comfortable night. 【Machine Washable & Easy Care】As the comforter is packaged in a vacuum bag, we suggest you to open the vacuum bag, and spread it in the sunlight for a few days and tap the comforter gently or machine wash in the gentle cycle with cold water, sun-dry or tumble dry on low when needed. 【After-sales Service】The brand name, ELNIDO QUEEN, will appear on the label of the product so don't mistakenly think that you have bought the wrong size when you see QUEEN on the label. The specific size will be written on the right end of the label.We pay great attention to the customer's experience and products' quality.If you have any problems after receiving the comforter,please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814M1ULvmAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELNIDO QUEEN","source_asin":"B08QCDX6C8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QCDX6C8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QCDX6C8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
