window.products.push({"id":549792,"name":"LXPRO Cooking Food Meat Temperature Digital Thermometer for Smoker Oven Kitchen BBQ Grill Thermometer Clock Timer with Large LCD Display Stainless Ste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lp3ZLOpJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"LxPro: Cook Like A Pro Every Time! The LxPro LX8015 food thermometer allows an experienced or inexperienced cook to measure the internal temperature of their meat, accurately and quickly. With the STEP-DOWN probe tip design and LCD display, getting and seeing an accurate temperature is simple. Either place on your counter with the flip out stand or magnetize to a metal surface, be it a BBQ or oven. Don't worry about losing track of time as this cooking thermometer also contains a timer. Lastly, if you aren't a pro in the kitchen, we include preset temperatures. Features: - Large LCD display to easily determine meat temperature - 3 Bigger buttom for easily current settings - Countdown timer and alarm function - Flip-out counter top stand and Magnetic Back - Probe and Wire can withstand up to 716°F (380°C) Specifications: Temperature Range: 32°F to 572°F (0°C to 300°C) Battery: 1 x AAA battery Temperature Accuracy: 1.8°F (1°C) from 32 to 212°F (0 to 100°C) Resolution: 1° Probe Length: 6.5\" food grade stainless probe Cable Length: 40\" stainless steel mesh cable LCD Display Size: 1.3 H×1.8 W inches (33 H×46 W mm) Dimensions: 2.9 H×2.6 W×0.8 D inches (73 H×65 W×20 D mm) Weight: 0.2 lbs. (90 g) Uses: BBQ, Oven, Smoker, Candy, Meat, Food","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lp3ZLOpJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LXPRO","source_asin":"B07D2H8BC2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D2H8BC2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D2H8BC2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":549793,"name":"Homesick Scented Candle, Friday Night","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ewWJpmrgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description There’s a feeling that exists within every state, small town or city – an energy all its own. The smell of the air, the sounds of the morning and the memories that reside there can fill us with nostalgia when we return or rifle through mementos. These places exist in our memories, and though life often relocates us, the sentiment for our experience there remains. From the Manufacturer Bring home to you, no matter where you are Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. States, Cities, Countries and Memories Whether it’s the seabreezes of Southern California, the distinctive scents of spring days in Central Park in NYC or the vibrance of the energy that pulses through Brasil we have you covered. Books Scent: The main theme is an older leather bound book accord mixed with a woody desk character of cedar and sandalwood. Hints of balsamic and vanilla finish the complex scent. Grandmas Kitchen Table Scent: The scents of rich butter mixed with touches of apple, cinnamon, clove and a hint of sugar cookie. Tonka bean and sugar finish out this homey aroma. Summer Camp Scent: Fresh green grass accord with hints of crystal clear lake water, blooming hyacinth found along trails and just a touch of fresh lemon and smoke. Take Me Home Scent is the strongest tie to memory. Inhaling those sweet aromas while your mind immediately travesl back to those carefree days or amazing experienes. Home can mean so many things and it can be in so many places. Homesick Candles allows you bring bring all of those memories with you, no matter where you go! From your childhood state, to the city where you got engaged, to the best vacation ever in Hawaii to that epic Road Trip with your friends. We have a custom scent for all US States, iconic cities, vibrant countries and those memorable experiences. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Nostalgic, Memories, All-Natural How did you come up with the idea for this product? We were living in NYC and yet all of us were from somewhere else and missing home. In the winter of 2016, we sought out to find a way to keep that place with you, no matter where you live. Homesick’s hand-poured candles began as a hobby in our kitchen, and to this day we still create each unique candle by hand, one by one. Using input from locals in various states, we crafted scents that embody those places and bring us back home. keep that place with you, no matter where you live. What makes your product special? We finely craft custom scents that are tied to places and memories. Nostalgia in the warmth of a candle. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Collaborating with other small businesses and local input. We feel like we've taken a road trip thru the entire USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ewWJpmrgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homesick","source_asin":"B076BHZ7G5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076BHZ7G5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076BHZ7G5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
