window.products.push({"id":549818,"name":"Microphone 4.5 Inch Cookie Cutter from The Cookie Cutter Shop – Tin Plated Steel Cookie Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21LRyuL4DfS._AC_.jpg","description":"Microphone 4.5 inch cookie cutter is made from tin plated steel and is food grade certified. This cookie cutter has rolled edges on top making it safe and comfortable to handle. With its sharp bottom it allows for accurate cutting that creates impressive results.  Our cookie cutters are perfect for so many projects. They are great for cutting cookie dough, brownies, cakes, fondant, soft fruits, vegetables, bread, cheese, sandwiches and craft clay. In addition, use your cookie cutters as a pancake mold or in the classroom as drawing tools. The possibilities are endless!  Use our Microphone 4.5 inch cookie cutter to bake some delicious cookies and decorate them to server at birthday parties, weddings, summer picnics, church or school functions, bake sales or to your family and friends. Cookie Cutter Care - After using your cookie cutters, hand wash and towel dry them. Then place them on a clean cookie sheet in your oven as it cools down from baking. The heat will dry out any remaining water that you may have missed from towel drying. Tin plated steel cookie cutters are NOT Dishwasher Safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21LRyuL4DfS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THE COOKIE CUTTER SHOP SINCE 1999","source_asin":"B07J9Y9GH9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J9Y9GH9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J9Y9GH9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
