window.products.push({"id":549897,"name":"BOVIS 420ml USB Personal Desk Humidifier Portable Cordless Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier mini vaporizer for travel home office school outdoor ,Tilta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-CqhlJ7+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Product parameters】Operating voltage/current/power: DC5V/400mA/1.5-2W Water tank capacity: 420mLBattery capacity: 1200mA Charging time: 2-3 hoursUsage time: 3-5 hours Spray volume: 45-50mL/HProduct size: 4.4*3.4*5.8 inNet weight of product: 9.52 oz 【Operation description】·Spray operation: Click the humidifier button for the first time to continuously spray, and click the button for the second time to switch to intermittent spray (spray 3 seconds for 3 seconds),click the button for the third time to turn off the spray.·Night light operation: press 2 seconds long to turn on the colorful gradual change night light mode, press 2 seconds long again to lock the color of the light, press 2 seconds long again to turn off the light.·Indicator function: Charging status is red, Full state blue light【Package Includes】1 x Humidifier1 x data cable1 x Manual1x spare cotton swab12 Months Warranty.Certification:FCC/ROHS/CE 【Notes】 1.Whether it can be used with essential oils. ·This product is mainly used as a humidifier that can add 2～3 drops of flavor. If you add essential oil, make sure to clean the cotton swab and cup body in time after using, clean it at least once in 1 days.⚠:It is not recommended for frequent use of essential oils,prevent clogging ultrasonic atomizer. 2.Does not work and no mist, only spray it upside down: 1). Pay attention to the inner spring of the cotton tube, no spring ,the humidifier can't spray. (⚠:upside down is just to force water into the atomizer and it will emit mist for a short time, after the atomization port has accumulated water, The fog will stop.)2).Please full charge and add water before using. 3. Stops work suddenly during use: please check whether there is water in the water tank, whether the product has power, and whether there is water in the mist outlet(wipe it)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-CqhlJ7+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOVIS","source_asin":"B07ZSHMJHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-549897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZSHMJHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZSHMJHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
